message: "Please cite the twin-volume edition and identify the individual volume when citing a theorem. Each companion preserves its own release metadata."
title: "Realization Calculus: Komorebi Space and Realization Boundaries"
authors:
  - family-names: "P."
    given-names: "Komorebi"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-24"
abstract: >-
  A coordinated twin-volume edition pairing Komorebi Space with Realization
  Boundaries. Volume I develops coherent realizations, obstruction, descent,
  transport, and repair. Volume II studies finite grammar, infinite abelian
  groups, common profinite completions, and the limits of reconstruction.
  This editorial edition preserves the separately accepted mathematical
  developments and their distinct formal scopes and reuse terms.
keywords:
  - realization
  - coherent families
  - obstruction theory
  - profinite completion
  - computable structures
  - Lean
